  PromptDialogue: "Agh, back in the day, almost everything was made through factories
    powered by coal, and we\u2019d even drive without seatbelts, and somehow survived.
    This whole \u201CClimate Change\u201D Shenanigans is just another excuse to make
    everyone soft and spend more."
  correctCardName: ChangeOrRegret
  correctCardSelected: "You know what? That actually makes sense. People have always
    adapted to problems, so maybe tackling climate change is just another step forward.
    I guess resisting change doesn\u2019t really help anyone."
  incorrectCardSelected: "That doesn't make sense at all. You clearly don\u2019t
    understand how all of this really works."
